  "details": "It would be very helpful if Input.mousePosition were exposed to Udon.\n\nThis would allow world creators to perform raycasts from the actual desktop cursor position when the user is holding TAB.\n\nAdditionally, an option to make the TAB key act as a toggle (rather than requiring it to be held) would improve usability for desktop players.\n\nI understand that VRChat is primarily designed for VR use, but many players enjoy spending time with their friends without always wearing their headset and often switch to desktop mode.\n\nImproving input support for this mode would make world interactions much more comfortable and consistent for them.",
